<p style="line-height: 20.8px; text-align: justify;">Whether you need seamless academic transfer classes; high-wage, high-demand career technical or health science programs; rapid training opportunities that get you into the workforce quickly; dual enrollment, or adult education courses, Bevill State is your community college for quality education. Contact us today to see how we can help you, 800.648.3271.</p>

