    <div id="maincontent" class="content">
        <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:28px;">Bevill State's four main campuses, and one instructional site, offer university parallel and applied technology educational opportunities to over one-quarter million people in a seven county area. With a service area that spans over 4,600 square miles, from the Birmingham city limits to the Mississippi state line, Your Story Starts at Bevill State!</span></p>

    
