        <aside>
    <p id="date">Oct 22, 2026</p>
    <h3><a href="/about/news/mccay-named-new-dean-of-health-sciences-for-bevill-state">McCay named new dean of health sciences for Bevill State</a></h3>
    <p>Dr. Kristen McCay was recently named Bevill State Community College’s new dean of health sciences. McCay has been with Bevill State since 2020, first working as a nursing instructor in Sumiton and most recently as the nursing simulation coordinator in Jasper. </p>
    <!-- <p>Full Story »</p> -->
</aside><aside>
    <p id="date">Oct 06, 2026</p>
    <h3><a href="/about/news/new-restaurant-to-open-on-jasper-campus">New restaurant to open on Jasper campus</a></h3>
    <p>A new restaurant will soon open on Bevill State’s Jasper campus. Frederick’s Café will be located in the Frances Israel Cafeteria in the Wade Math & Science Building. It will be operated by Dan Frederick, who also owns Bevill Café on the college’s Sumiton campus.</p>
    <!-- <p>Full Story »</p> -->
</aside><aside>
    <p id="date">Oct 06, 2026</p>
    <h3><a href="/about/news/mcdaniel-serving-in-new-leadership-role-at-bevill-state">McDaniel serving in new leadership role at Bevill State</a></h3>
    <p>Shawn McDaniel has been named vice president of instruction and student services for Bevill State Community College.</p>
    <!-- <p>Full Story »</p> -->
</aside>
