            <p>Privacy Policy: Any personal information that you may share with Bevill State Community College is kept absolutely private. Neither your name nor anything about you is sold or shared with any other company or agency or institution. Occasionally, we may contact you to make you aware of upcoming events. However, we do respect your right to privacy and will not send notices if you contact us and opt out of future notices.</p>
